uary and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 35 of 75 years. In 2025, November to December finished at 49% of normal and April to May at 146%. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 48% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 17584 had its driest year in 2007 at 62%.</p>"}
